{"id": "01M1W6QR657C7MAQJ6742VMKF9", "trailId": "01M0DNQ8XCZ8B0FB39BG34XAGZ", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M1W6QR4BSDYC5V9Z2X2HCJPH", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "actorDisplayName": null, "body": "`addWorkspaceRepoLocked` now takes `workspaceManifestLockName` before its read-modify-write, but `runWorkspaceRefresh` loads the manifest unlocked, runs a potentially long `workspaceFullRefresh`, then unconditionally overwrites the whole file via `writeWorkspaceManifest` at line 750 with its stale in-memory copy. Any repo added or removed by a concurrent locked `add`/`remove` while the refresh ran is silently reverted, with no error or lock contention.", "severity": "high", "confidence": 0.8, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "statusActorId": null, "statusActorDisplayName": null, "statusChangedAt": null, "statusSource": null, "statusActorKind": null, "staleOutcome": "stale", "staleCheckedAt": "2026-09-06T21:10:41.715Z", "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": "01M1W8Y8R875KWFY92XG5PN9R6", "clientId": "b18ec80475fae145a5077a54150202e2", "clientIdHash": "13a33aa40c4f40c3e145f7b9651de017c23c97cae6a1e178f077f0e8414fac06", "createdAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.949Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.949Z", "location": {"id": "01M1W6QR65GZFK1TT3804GBEFW", "reviewCommentId": "01M1W6QR657C7MAQJ6742VMKF9", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "granularity": "line", "filePath": "internal/cli/workspace.go", "startLine": 750, "startColumn": null, "endLine": null, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "	if err := writeWorkspaceManifest(opts.Env, manifest); err != nil {", "nearbyText": null, "language": null}}
{"id": "01M1W6QR63RDN1RMGAX1569346", "trailId": "01M0DNQ8XCZ8B0FB39BG34XAGZ", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M1W6QR4BSDYC5V9Z2X2HCJPH", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "actorDisplayName": null, "body": "`totalSessions` (the progress denominator) only excludes sessions filtered by `--branch`/`--session`, but sessions deferred by `--max-sessions` (`ps.deferred` at line 975) `continue` without ever incrementing `sessionsDone` or calling `reportProgress()`. Once the session budget is exhausted, the reported progress permanently freezes below `totalSessions` even though the pipeline keeps doing real work reading/preprocessing each deferred session — making a live backfill look stalled for the rest of the run.", "severity": "medium", "confidence": 0.75, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "statusActorId": null, "statusActorDisplayName": null, "statusChangedAt": null, "statusSource": null, "statusActorKind": null, "staleOutcome": "stale", "staleCheckedAt": "2026-09-06T21:10:41.715Z", "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": "01M1W8Y8R875KWFY92XG5PN9R6", "clientId": "ba4e4085b065e9e679e62903d4441e5d", "clientIdHash": "d6bcb491c064e7212af28dcc6e5bff8234bb6db18bd598d539e7fe4e57a69a0b", "createdAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.946Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.946Z", "location": {"id": "01M1W6QR6373YZ8Q7JYBV65XNK", "reviewCommentId": "01M1W6QR63RDN1RMGAX1569346", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "granularity": "line", "filePath": "internal/cli/distill_cmd.go", "startLine": 975, "startColumn": null, "endLine": null, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "		if ps.skip || ps.deferred {", "nearbyText": null, "language": null}}
{"id": "01M1W6QR6098CRKPQHZACNAQAY", "trailId": "01M0DNQ8XCZ8B0FB39BG34XAGZ", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M1W6QR4BSDYC5V9Z2X2HCJPH", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "actorDisplayName": null, "body": "On Windows, `detachedSysProcAttr` returns `nil` instead of setting `CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP` via `SysProcAttr.CreationFlags`. `CTRL_C_EVENT` is delivered to every process in the same console process group regardless of stdio redirection, so a user who Ctrl-C's `setup` on Windows will also kill the 'detached' background backfill child, contradicting the documented detachment guarantee (see the Unix sibling's `Setsid: true`).", "severity": "medium", "confidence": 0.6, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "statusActorId": null, "statusActorDisplayName": null, "statusChangedAt": null, "statusSource": null, "statusActorKind": null, "staleOutcome": "stale", "staleCheckedAt": "2026-09-06T21:10:41.715Z", "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": "01M1W8Y8R875KWFY92XG5PN9R6", "clientId": "b0b5b601ee2c4552748b7b110f45f93a", "clientIdHash": "0e0166dba00ef54c3c632d3e998d2be3ac5a3a6188301ccfc52f47f36388a627", "createdAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.944Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.944Z", "location": {"id": "01M1W6QR605QW18G277XEA8M2E", "reviewCommentId": "01M1W6QR6098CRKPQHZACNAQAY", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "granularity": "line", "filePath": "internal/cli/setup_spawn_windows.go", "startLine": 13, "startColumn": null, "endLine": null, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "func detachedSysProcAttr() *syscall.SysProcAttr {", "nearbyText": null, "language": null}}
{"id": "01M1W6QR5X8ZXK298MKNP89HC2", "trailId": "01M0DNQ8XCZ8B0FB39BG34XAGZ", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M1W6QR4BSDYC5V9Z2X2HCJPH", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "actorDisplayName": null, "body": "`retireRenamedDaemon`'s result (including a failure to retire a stale watcher) is only reported via `progress.Skip(detail)`, but `progressOut` is `io.Discard` in `--json` mode (set earlier in this function). Unlike every other failure path here, this one is never appended to `report.Warnings`, so a scripted/non-interactive caller running `setup --json` gets no signal that an old daemon failed to retire and may still be running under its previous name.", "severity": "medium", "confidence": 0.7, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "statusActorId": null, "statusActorDisplayName": null, "statusChangedAt": null, "statusSource": null, "statusActorKind": null, "staleOutcome": "stale", "staleCheckedAt": "2026-09-06T21:10:41.715Z", "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": "01M1W8Y8R875KWFY92XG5PN9R6", "clientId": "deed6b11322a68e0b4a9c8e918a00afd", "clientIdHash": "7bfa17702b8a7443ee5f646fa7204ff8f4944cbdf063151f72b2c138345e0582", "createdAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.941Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.941Z", "location": {"id": "01M1W6QR5XBY0XHXPH2RKYPKKX", "reviewCommentId": "01M1W6QR5X8ZXK298MKNP89HC2", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "granularity": "range", "filePath": "internal/cli/setup.go", "startLine": 605, "startColumn": null, "endLine": 606, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "	if detail := retireRenamedDaemon(ctx, setupOpts, previousName, previousKnown, steps, planErr); detail != "" {
