{"id": "01M1W6QR4GKX81TAERQCF62S8G", "trailId": "01M0DNQ8XCZ8B0FB39BG34XAGZ", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M1W6QR4BSDYC5V9Z2X2HCJPH", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "actorDisplayName": null, "body": "`--uninstall-daemon` returns via `runSetupUninstall` using the `plan` built from `steps.plan(setupOpts)` (line 580), which is derived from this repo's own `setup.json` record — but the machine-wide watch plan (`loadSetupWatchPlan`) and `installedDaemonName` resolution, which the surrounding code says is 'the authority on which watcher is installed,' are only loaded afterward at lines 596/604 and are never consulted here. If another repo renamed the shared daemon (`--daemon-name`), this repo's `--uninstall-daemon` resolves the stale/default name, reports 'no watcher was installed', and exits 0 while the real watcher keeps running — permanently unreachable by the one documented removal command.", "severity": "high", "confidence": 0.85, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "statusActorId": null, "statusActorDisplayName": null, "statusChangedAt": null, "statusSource": null, "statusActorKind": null, "staleOutcome": "stale", "staleCheckedAt": "2026-09-06T21:10:41.715Z", "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": "01M1W8Y8R875KWFY92XG5PN9R6", "clientId": "b9cd325185bdc937a9eb0e88da595123", "clientIdHash": "4c55ef6b726596d76820bc41b8b291e1ac6d298d32fcba3efc9602791396aad9", "createdAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.896Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T20:32:10.896Z", "location": {"id": "01M1W6QR4GZ7C3PV1168AT86NK", "reviewCommentId": "01M1W6QR4GKX81TAERQCF62S8G", "codeVersionId": "01M1W6A04XJS8PPDVR8DT5TTXP", "granularity": "range", "filePath": "internal/cli/setup.go", "startLine": 587, "startColumn": null, "endLine": 588, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "	if setupOpts.uninstallDaemon {
